Text=Hello traveler. I am Esteban, guardsman of the crossroads of Barcelona. I'd advise you to be cautious when traveling, as there are dangers just beyond the roads. I have served at this post for many years, so if you have any questions about the wilderness you may ask.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
